    <td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="postbody">Also, they've added so much to the game it's just silly.  They have low level battlegrounds now, starting at 14th level.  Plus, you get quest-type xp for playing the in the battegrounds as well.
<br />

<br />
No xp loss in RvR anymore, so I hear.  
<br />

<br />
/level allows you to create 20-30th level characters on ANY server in ANY realm, no matter what you played to 50th.
<br />

<br />
Player housing was done.
<br />

<br />
Graphics upgrade
<br />

<br />
Big melee upgrade for RvR, added large magic resists (up to 50%) and special realm abilities.  
<br />

<br />
Dowsides:
<br />

<br />
Lots of realm imbalance.  Albion is dominant on most servers.  Midgard is hurting.  Hib is hurting real bad, on some servers having lost all their relics and all their keeps.</span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
