          <td><span class="postbody">No DAOC character has ever been deleted.  Mythic posted this about a month ago.  So you're still there.
<br />

<br />
Also, big changes on the horizon for DAOC that sound nice.  Mythic anounced this week that all developer time for the next 6 months will be geared towards revamping the existing game; ie revamping old zones, new quests, etc.  This is in lieu of a string of more expansions.
<br />

<br />
In line with this, their first task is a massive overhaul of PvP, which should go live in the next month.  Battlegrounds, borderlands, class balance in PvP, etc will all be redone.
<br />

<br />
Also, as a note to some of the old timers, the level grind in DAOC has been lessened some.  The xp from 30-50 mobs was increased, and several very high xp quests were put in.  I understand that the "epic" quests for each class yield about a full bubble per completion section even at 49th.</span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
